  "description": "Han Min-Seo grew up in a wealthy and harmonious family. One day, she witnesses her parents' car leaving a motel across from a restaurant she stopped by with her friends. However, Min-Seo does not know which of her parents drove the car. Is it a simple misunderstanding, or is it really an affair? In a truth she does not want to believe, will Min-Seo be able to protect herself and face the truth until the end?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
